@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam padding 8
skinparam dpi 180
hide footbox
autonumber
participant "Runtime" as R
participant "advice.Agent" as A
participant "advice 包内辅助函数\n与 modelAdvice 方法" as F
participant "model.Client" as M
R -> R : decide(...)\nsameAdviceInputs(prev, inputs)
alt 上一快照 ready 且输入相同
 R -> F : WithAirportTimeSimulation(previous.Advice, input)
 F --> R : 复用的 Advice
else 生成新建议
 R -> A : Evaluate(ctx, advice.Input)
 A -> A : evaluate(ctx, in)
 A -> F : userPrompt(in)\nComputeTimeFacts(state, progress, etaMin, now)
 A -> M : 经 model.GenerateJSON 调用 Chat(ctx, req)
 M --> A : 模型 JSON 或错误
 A -> F : modelAdvice.valid() / toDomain(nav)\nBuildAirportNav(iata, origin)
 A -> A : 手动阶段覆盖 result.Stage
 A -> F : enforceRiskFloor(result, in)
 A -> F : ensureAirportNav(result, in)
 A -> F : WithAirportTimeSimulation(result, in)
 A --> R : domain.Advice
end
note over A,M : 模型缺失或失败时 evaluate 返回降级 Advice\n其后仍执行阶段覆盖 风险兜底和工具导航补充
note over R : decide 还可有条件保留上一版建议内容\n完整签名和分支条件见正文

@enduml
